{<b>What is 2/1 GF?</b>

• Two-over-one responses…

  – Are natural

  – Promise opening values

  – Are forcing to game

• Affects some other bids:

  – Rebids after a 2/1 GF response are affected profoundly

  – 1NT response to 1\H or 1\S opening bid shows 6–<u>12</u> points

  – Jump-shifts to the three-level are natural and invitational (recommended)

• Does not affect any other bidding!}
[BCFlags "17"]

