{<b>Why Play 2/1 GF?</b>

• Standard 2/1 responses can leave the partnership in “no man's land,”
uncertain of where and how high to bid

• 2/1 responses establish a forcing situation that permits careful exploration
for the best strain, and whether slam is a good bet

• Used by nearly all expert players who play a natural system}
[BCFlags "17"]

