{<b>Requirements for a 2/1 GF Response</b>

• 13 total points

• Usually a 5-card suit, but may be done with 4, or rarely 3 if no better bid

  !!! 1\S–2\H promises five, just as in standard

• Does not apply if responder is a passed hand

• Does not apply if there is competition (double or overcall)}
[BCFlags "17"]

