{<b>Opener's Rebid after 2/1 GF</b>

Opener's rebid shows shape of hand <u>without regard to strength of hand</u>:

• Rebid suit with 6+ cards

• Bid a new suit (4+ cards), even if a reverse (recommended)

• Bid 2NT (balanced, 12–14 or 18–19)

• Bid 3NT (balanced, 15–17)

• Raise responder

• Jumps are rare and show special hands}
[BCFlags "17"]

