{<b>Responder's Rebid after 2/1 GF</b>

Responder's rebid shows shape and may clarify strength:

<i><u>Shape</u></i>

  – Delayed raise of opener's major shows 3-card support, never 2 or 4

  – Raise of opener's second suit shows 4-card support, never 3

  – Rebid 6-card suit

  – Bid a second 4-card suit

  – Bid notrump with a balanced hand}
[BCFlags "17"]

